      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "The span explicitly attributes possible behavioral changes to instrumentation."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C076_signal_basis",
    "value": "The proposed instrumentation canary adds phase timing and coverage metadata with sampling and logging overhead. The operation sets acceptable instrumentation overhead and outcome bounds, and monitors changes in phases, overall tail delays, failures and unfinished exports.",
    "scope": "Proposed canary instrumentation and monitoring; these provisions do not establish that instrumentation actually caused a behavioral change.",
